invariant: INV-16
file: ct.h
catches: mlkem_test_ct_widemul
reason: narrowing ct_widemul_opaque's volatile copy of b to 16 bits
  truncates the 1290168 mlk_compress passes, so every compressed
  coefficient is wrong; the native builds in check never run this arm,
  softmul_test skips the opaque form, and the equivalence proof's 8-bit
  bound never reaches an operand the narrowing changes, so only the
  FIPS 203 answers over the decomposition see it

--- old
    volatile uint32_t vb = b;
--- new
    volatile uint16_t vb = (uint16_t)b;
